Definition

The right to keep personal information safe and control how it is shared.



AI Risks

Data Breaches and Unauthorized Access

AI systems often rely on vast amounts of personal data, increasing the potential for data breaches. This risk is immediate and ongoing, as cybercriminals continuously target AI-powered systems to access sensitive information.";}s:8:"relation";a:3:{s:5:"media";a:3:{s:52:"sidebar:categories:ethics:privacy-10x10-featured.jpg";b:1;s:53:"sidebar:categories:ethics:1920x640-cityscape.jpg.webp";b:1;s:70:"sidebar:categories:ethics:5-reasons-why-data-privacy-is-important.webp";b:1;}s:10:"references";a:6:{s:16:"glossary:consent";b:1;s:48:"glossary:personally_identifiable_information_pii";b:1;s:22:"glossary:anonymization";b:0;s:23:"glossary:access_control";b:0;s:19:"glossary:encryption";b:0;s:38:"glossary:privacy_impact_assessment_pia";b:0;}s:10:"firstimage";s:52:"sidebar:categories:ethics:privacy-10x10-featured.jpg";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1744831568;}s:7:"creator";s:11:"Aditya Seth";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:11:"last_change";a:9:{s:4:"date";i:1744831568;s:2:"ip";s:14:"73.235.164.232";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:16:"glossary:privacy";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:3:"sum";s:7:"created";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:4820;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}